sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as EvaluationPage
  participant API as evaluationApi
  participant Auth as protect Middleware
  participant C as evaluationController
  participant OM as Order Model
  participant EM as Evaluation Model
  participant PM as Product Model
  UI->>API: create evaluation
  API->>Auth: POST /api/evaluations
  Auth->>C: createEvaluation
  C->>OM: verify completed order and buyer
  C->>EM: check duplicate + create
  C->>PM: update rating and count
  EM-->>UI: published evaluation
  UI->>C: seller reply
  C->>EM: append reply thread
  EM-->>UI: evaluation with reply
